"The Distal Expansion is the galactic civilization the Questors come from."
"The Expansion's Golden Rules of Severthorn are likened to a sleepless tyranny."
"Expansion law bars its smart systems from making moral decisions."
"The Expansion makes artificial life aplenty but never sapient infrastructure."
"Something in the Expansion's ancient past made it fear intelligent systems."
"The Questors are denied the greater galaxy."
